  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting (Cooldown), Control Caster</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> As long as you have an ongoing effect affected by this metamagic feat active, no cards in any creature’s discard pile may leave that discard pile as long as that creature is within close range of the effect (or within the effect's area if the effect covers a range of close or greater.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> +2 spell points</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 3: Volatile Variance</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
